    <name>Boca do Inferno (Viewpoint) – Schöner Aussichtspunkt Runde von Candelária</name>
    <desc>Distance: 2.448km, Estimated duration: 0.66h, Elevation up: 29.51660003283962m, Elevation down: 29.166821031905783m, Grade: easy</desc>
